  <name>Helide</name>
  <summary>Personal Helium fork for Linux on Motobook 60 Pro</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Helide is a personal fork of Helium, tailored for Linux on the Motobook
      60 Pro. It is based on Helium and Chromium and is not an official Helium
      or Motorola product. Upstream copyright and license notices are preserved.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Configurable Wayland transparency and compositor blur</li>
      <li>Touchpad page-slide history navigation</li>
      <li>Linux battery-aware Energy Saver integration</li>
      <li>Background AI-agent access through the DevTools protocol</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
